    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect diamonds and avoid monsters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to collect all the diamonds to exit the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocks and diamonds can fall and kill you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing the game, you will receive:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- an exciting arcade game with platformer elements in which you need to explore areas in search of diamonds and avoid monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- dynamic gameplay that requires attentiveness, dexterity and strategic thinking, the ability to plan your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- satisfaction from completing levels and achieving the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, you will find an exciting game with survival elements, where you need to show dexterity and strategic thinking to collect all the diamonds, avoiding dangerous monsters and deadly falling objects.</p>",
